{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function extractSimpleComparisons(expr): SimpleComparison[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/expression-helpers.ts#L332","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/query/expression-helpers.ts:332"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extracts all simple comparisons from a WHERE expression.\nThis is useful for simple APIs that only support basic filters."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Note: This only works for simple AND-ed conditions and NOT-wrapped comparisons.\nThrows an error if it encounters unsupported operations like OR or complex nested expressions."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NOT operators are flattened by prefixing the operator name (e.g., "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"not(eq(...))"},{"type":"text","value":" becomes "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"not_eq"},{"type":"text","value":")."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"expr","children":[{"type":"text","value":"expr"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The WHERE expression to parse"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"BasicExpression"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"},{"type":"text","value":"> | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"null"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/SimpleComparison.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SimpleComparison"}]},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Array of simple comparisons"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"throws","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Throws"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Error if expression contains OR or other unsupported operations"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const comparisons = extractSimpleComparisons(where)\n// Returns: [\n//   { field: ['category'], operator: 'eq', value: 'electronics' },\n//   { field: ['price'], operator: 'lt', value: 100 },\n//   { field: ['email'], operator: 'isNull' }, // No value for null checks\n//   { field: ['status'], operator: 'not_eq', value: 'archived' }\n// ]","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"expr","text":"expr","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"throws","text":"Throws","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction extractSimpleComparisons(expr): SimpleComparison[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/expression-helpers.ts:332](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/expression-helpers.ts#L332)\n\nExtracts all simple comparisons from a WHERE expression.\nThis is useful for simple APIs that only support basic filters.\n\nNote: This only works for simple AND-ed conditions and NOT-wrapped comparisons.\nThrows an error if it encounters unsupported operations like OR or complex nested expressions.\n\nNOT operators are flattened by prefixing the operator name (e.g., `not(eq(...))` becomes `not_eq`).\n\n## Parameters\n\n### expr\n\nThe WHERE expression to parse\n\n`BasicExpression`\\<`boolean`\\> | `null` | `undefined`\n\n## Returns\n\n[`SimpleComparison`](../interfaces/SimpleComparison.md)[]\n\nArray of simple comparisons\n\n## Throws\n\nError if expression contains OR or other unsupported operations\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst comparisons = extractSimpleComparisons(where)\n// Returns: [\n//   { field: ['category'], operator: 'eq', value: 'electronics' },\n//   { field: ['price'], operator: 'lt', value: 100 },\n//   { field: ['email'], operator: 'isNull' }, // No value for null checks\n//   { field: ['status'], operator: 'not_eq', value: 'archived' }\n// ]\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: extractSimpleComparisons\ntitle: extractSimpleComparisons\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction extractSimpleComparisons(expr): SimpleComparison[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/expression-helpers.ts:332](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/expression-helpers.ts#L332)\n\nExtracts all simple comparisons from a WHERE expression.\nThis is useful for simple APIs that only support basic filters.\n\nNote: This only works for simple AND-ed conditions and NOT-wrapped comparisons.\nThrows an error if it encounters unsupported operations like OR or complex nested expressions.\n\nNOT operators are flattened by prefixing the operator name (e.g., `not(eq(...))` becomes `not_eq`).\n\n## Parameters\n\n### expr\n\nThe WHERE expression to parse\n\n`BasicExpression`\\<`boolean`\\> | `null` | `undefined`\n\n## Returns\n\n[`SimpleComparison`](../interfaces/SimpleComparison.md)[]\n\nArray of simple comparisons\n\n## Throws\n\nError if expression contains OR or other unsupported operations\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst comparisons = extractSimpleComparisons(where)\n// Returns: [\n//   { field: ['category'], operator: 'eq', value: 'electronics' },\n//   { field: ['price'], operator: 'lt', value: 100 },\n//   { field: ['email'], operator: 'isNull' }, // No value for null checks\n//   { field: ['status'], operator: 'not_eq', value: 'archived' }\n// ]\n```\n"}
